  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The class org.fcrepo.utilities.LogConfig initializes the logback configuration with its initFromFile method.  It does so, however, by setting the system property ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ],
       "text": "logback.configurationFile",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " if it is not already set.  This leads to one of the following problems:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "If the property is already set, the fedora logback configuration is not used.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "If the property is not already set, Fedora sets it, overriding any logback.xml files that may be on the classpath, even for other web applications.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "A better way to programmatically load a logback configuration, just for your own webapplication, would be to use a ServletContextListener and have it execute something like the following in its contextInitialized method:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "LoggerContext lc = (LoggerContext) LoggerFactory.getILoggerFactory();\n       JoranConfigurator configurator = new JoranConfigurator();\n       configurator.setContext(lc);\n       lc.reset();\n       configurator.doConfigure(externalConfigFile);\n       logger.info(\"Configured Logback with config file from: {}\", externalConfigFile.getAbsolutePath());",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
  "duedate": null,
  "environment": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Tomcat 6 (but probably other web containers, too)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
